## 3. Core Responsibilities

Build a backend marketplace and directory for real-estate professionals and service providers.

Support:

1. Individual professional profiles.
2. Service-provider business profiles.
3. Multi-person provider organizations.
4. Professional categories and specialties.
5. Service catalog and service descriptions.
6. Service-area coverage.
7. Professional qualifications and credentials.
8. Credential submission and verification status.
9. Provider availability information.
10. Provider discovery and filtering.
11. Customer service requests.
12. Requests for quotations.
13. Provider quotation responses.
14. Customer comparison of quotations.
15. Customer selection and referral records.
16. Customer feedback and service reviews.
17. Provider profile performance indicators.
18. Organization membership and delegated management.
19. Provider profile lifecycle.
20. Data-quality and provenance tracking.

This module manages professional discovery and service-request workflows. It does not execute payments, create legally binding contracts, or manage the actual delivery of construction or property-management projects.

